DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260728T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260728T184500
SUMMARY:outdoor mat pilates
DESCRIPTION:Outdoor Flow Yogis\nEnjoy movement and breath work with 45-min
 ute classic mat pilates sessions at [Dix Park](https://dixpark.org/). Thes
 e FREE outdoor classes welcome all experience levels and focus on core str
 ength and stability\, coordination\, and flexibility. Bring a mat\, towel\
 , and filled water bottle. Allow yourself a little extra time for parking\
 , we'll get started right at 6:00pm.
