BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Outdoor Flow Yogis
UID:event_314834734@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260724T033024Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260816T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260816T114500
SUMMARY:Movewell at Weaver Street Market
DESCRIPTION:Outdoor Flow Yogis\nJoin Erica at [Weaver Street Market](https
 ://www.weaverstreetmarket.coop/location/raleigh/) for donation-based\, ope
 n-level yoga classes. Expand your movement practice and uplift our local c
 ommunity with this weekend flow!\n\n**45-min YOGA FLOW + CHILL** integrate
 s breathwork\, flowing waves of movement\, and meditation. Classes take pl
 ace upstairs in the Weaver Street Market event space. Street parking is fr
 ee on weekends - bring your own mat and a water bottle.\n\n**Sliding scale
  pricing aka "pay what you can" via cash\, venmo\, or paypal.** *NOTE - 50
 % of the proceeds from each class will be donated to [A Place At The Table
 ](https://tableraleigh.org/) \\- Raleigh's first pay\\-what\\-you\\-can ca
 fe\\.*
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/outdoorflowyogis/events/314834734/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260517T191227Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260517T191227Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
